 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iERVsYCgg_AQ7kNvwFnw-CP&_nc_oc=Adrgw8hZFRelzmbGEccUMxJFdSC0L463j16MJjivB-XXYKVVuRztYYu2NIecSbgN6T0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGmijQ_2M1W2BAV4--MKxhDE2Op3lM8OLcCZ-lGMSF9Jw&oe=6A74A5C1"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pKF_jydnAgwQ7kNvwFAjClJ&_nc_oc=AdreZW5EnBDDmjkHmbsUu-K8nT69gME6tEqGgsW2WVSMgDnCTdVWKFdhizi5kUyZZYY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGucrP_XRoKgGXhrgfGehxlCr0lwdOuxY43H1yJ7Qq2UA&oe=6A747AE6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rdAy8fDUFTUQ7kNvwG2wLcS&_nc_oc=AdpPkCSFfy9_OZP2akxGOCyMYXCvcxIft6sywoLx9Wz-PKNGSif-zg049ZJ1hNpbMWQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGno7PdIaj5U4HQ7TAlypoml7VKhV_1-FtdMwWU-lIStA&oe=6A7484DC"}, {"fil